<title>FINLAND: HANDELSBANKEN SEES 3.3 PCT FINNISH 1997 GDP GROWTH.</title>
<headline>HANDELSBANKEN SEES 3.3 PCT FINNISH 1997 GDP GROWTH.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Handelsbanken's</p>
<p>chief economist Carlo Erakallio said in a statement received on</p>
<p>Friday he expects Finnish gross domestic product to increase 3.3</p>
<p>percent in 1997 after 2.3 percent growth this year.</p>
<p>Key figures in Handelsbanken's forecast:</p>
<p>					 1996	  1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP				   +2.3	  +3.3	 +3.5</p>
<p> Exports			     +1.9	    +5	   +5</p>
<p> Imports			     +2.9	    +5	 +5.1</p>
<p> Private consumption		 +3	  +3.3	   +3</p>
<p> Investment			  +3.2	  +6.5	   +6</p>
<p> Consumer prices		   +0.7	  +1.5	 +2.3</p>
<p> Industrial output		 +3.5	    +5	   +5</p>
<p> Earnings			    +3.9	  +2.5	 +3.5</p>
<p> Unemployment			16.3	  15.2	 14.2</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
